Colombiana is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Olivier Megaton.

3
00:17:03,157 --> 00:17:09,157
After witnessing her parents’ murder as a child in Bogota,
Cataleya Restrepo grows up to be a stone-cold assassin.

4
